OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSome bright spells to start the
OL,6,Fday. Showers spreading across the
OL,7,Fregion as the day progresses, some of
OL,8,Fthese being heavy with hail and
OL,9,Fthunder possible. Temperatures near
OL,10,Fthe seasonal average and feeling warm
OL,11,Fin any sunny spells.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers fading inland during
OL,14,Fthe evening, then becoming largely dry
OL,15,Fovernight with clear spells. Slightly
OL,16,Fbreezy along the coast with isolated
OL,17,Fshowers continuing. Less muggy than
OL,18,Frecent nights.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
