OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FFine for much of Friday with
OL,6,Fsunny spells and variable cloud.
OL,7,FMostly dry but some isolated showers
OL,8,Falong the coast and then more broadly
OL,9,Fto end the day. Feeling fresher.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,12,FBecoming more settled with an
OL,13,Fincreasing number of sunny spells.
OL,14,FSmall chance of a shower on Saturday.
OL,15,FTemperatures below average for August
OL,16,Fbut feeling pleasant where the
OL,17,Fsunshine emerges.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
